    {
      "id": "opening",
      "title": "The gearbox you use every day",
      "role": "intro",
      "topic": "powertrain",
      "outcome": "",
      "usp_ids": [
        "choose-your-gears"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "CRETA's petrol without the turbo, and its diesel, offer manual or automatic gearboxes, with combinations set by trim. The lever pictured here shows the manual choice at the driver's seat.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_df8fadffe78c7af4bbc1",
            "focus": "Manual gearbox lever"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F008",
            "F009"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "opening-L1",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 15.8,
          "exact": false
        }
      ],
      "checkin": "",
      "deeper": [
        {
          "text": "The non-turbo petrol is the one-point-five-litre MPi engine, paired with a six-speed manual or IVT automatic. Which pairing is available depends on trim. The manual lever pictured here does not show an automatic selector.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_df8fadffe78c7af4bbc1",
            "focus": "Manual transmission example"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F009"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "opening-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "The separate one-point-five-litre diesel offers a six-speed manual or six-speed automatic, again with trim-specific combinations. These are gearbox specifications, without a measured shift-quality or fuel-economy comparison.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "ref": "im_pdf_df8fadffe78c7af4bbc1",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F008"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "opening-D2"
        }
      ],
      "stop_id": null,
      "fundamental": false,
      "word_budget": 30,
      "planned_seconds": 15.8,
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 15.8,
      "spoken": 15.8,
      "measured": false
    },
    {
      "id": "three-choices",
      "title": "Your gears, seating and airbags",
      "role": "outcome",
      "topic": "highlights",
      "outcome": "Pick the buying choice that matters",
      "usp_ids": [
        "choose-your-gears",
        "share-the-room",
        "airbags-from-the-start"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Your gears, room for people and bags, and standard airbags from E are the anchors; you can interrupt. Gearboxes depend on engine and trim, with King's turbo available only as an automatic.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "ref": "im_pdf_df8fadffe78c7af4bbc1",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F005",
            "F006",
            "F008",
            "F009",
            "F022",
            "F023",
            "F025"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "three-choices-L1",
          "start": 15.8,
          "duration": 16.8,
          "exact": false
        }
      ],
      "checkin": "",
      "deeper": [
        {
          "text": "A split rear seat is fitted across the range. Its stated function is to balance passengers and storage; the open boot photograph supplies an example of luggage, without establishing a capacity or personal fit.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_06dc900e0519722a9b8a",
            "focus": "Sample boot contents"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F022",
            "F023"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "three-choices-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Six airbags are standard, including on E: driver, passenger, side and curtain. Their inclusion is an equipment fact, not a crash rating. No photograph of deployed airbags is included in this picture set.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "none",
            "ref": "",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F025"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "three-choices-D2"
        }
      ],
      "stop_id": null,
      "fundamental": false,
      "word_budget": 33,
      "planned_seconds": 17.4,
      "start": 15.8,
      "duration": 16.8,
